l=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e2d928f5-f3cd-40df-b13e-a1a45aa5aaa3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Looted from or pickpocketed off of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mirie\" title=\"Mirie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/25px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/38px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/50px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mirie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/25px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mirie\" title=\"Mirie\">Mirie</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Grief\" title=\"House of Grief\">House of Grief</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A self-help book, claiming to comfort those prone to hot tempers and violent urges.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Hot-bloodedness has its place within a healthy, balanced spirit. But what if the blood boils? What if a Violent heart spurs its possessor to dire thoughts, words, or even deeds? You must forgive your foe, help them up - even heal the wounds you opened upon them. For if you cannot heal them, how can you heal yourself? \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The book continues on at great length, suggesting treatments pioneered by the House of Grief may help, should self-improvement fail.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715015739\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1888/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31787/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8290/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931831/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.064      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.064      1 -total\n 57.52%   27.069      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.83%   23.922     19 Template:Trim\n 22.55%   10.613      2 Template:Uid\n 14.94%    7.029      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.96%    6.571      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.48%    6.343      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.29%    4.841      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.19%    4.794      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:43668-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715015739 and revision id 337514. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}